{"data":"明白，需求调整为：\n\n1. **只提取 `cdn-src-ip`**（去掉 XFF fallback）\n2. **增加白名单校验**：只有当实际 TCP 连接源 IP（`ngx.var.remote_addr`）在配置的可信 CIDR 白名单内时，才允许提取 `cdn-src-ip`。这样防止攻击者绕过 CDN 直连 WAF 伪造 `cdn-src-ip` 头。\n\n生成配置脚本：","time":"2026-06-19T12:11:11+08:00","type":"assistant_text"}
{"data":"{\"function\":\"generate_component_script\",\"arguments\":{\"name\":\"cdn_real_ip_extractor\",\"detail\":\"华为云CDN场景真实客户端IP提取组件。检查实际TCP连接源IP是否在可信CDN节点白名单(trusted_cidrs)内，仅可信来源才提取 cdn-src-ip 头作为真实客户端IP写入 ngx.ctx.src_ip，防止绕过CDN直连伪造。\",\"code_lua\":\"local _M = {}\\n\\nlocal bit = require \\\"bit\\\"\\n\\n-- IPv4 转为 32 位整数\\nlocal function ipv4_to_int(ip)\\n    if type(ip) ~= \\\"string\\\" then\\n        return nil\\n    end\\n    local a, b, c, d = ip:match(\\\"^(%d+)%.(%d+)%.(%d+)%.(%d+)$\\\")\\n    if not a then\\n        return nil\\n    end\\n    a, b, c, d = tonumber(a), tonumber(b), tonumber(c), tonumber(d)\\n    if not (a and b and c and d) then return nil end\\n    if a \u003e 255 or b \u003e 255 or c \u003e 255 or d \u003e 255 then return nil end\\n    return bit.bor(bit.lshift(a, 24), bit.lshift(b, 16), bit.lshift(c, 8), d)\\nend\\n\\n-- 检查 IP(整数) 是否在单个 CIDR 范围内\\nlocal function ip_in_cidr(ip_int, cidr_str)\\n    -- 带掩码: 1.2.3.0/24\\n    local cidr_ip, mask_bits = cidr_str:match(\\\"^(%d+%.%d+%.%d+%.%d+)/(%d+)$\\\")\\n    if cidr_ip then\\n        local cidr_int = ipv4_to_int(cidr_ip)\\n        if not cidr_int then return false end\\n        mask_bits = tonumber(mask_bits)\\n        if mask_bits \u003c 0 or mask_bits \u003e 32 then return false end\\n        if mask_bits == 0 then return true end\\n        local mask_int = bit.bnot(bit.rshift(0xFFFFFFFF, mask_bits))\\n        return bit.band(ip_int, mask_int) == bit.band(cidr_int, mask_int)\\n    end\\n    -- 不带掩码: 单个 IP\\n    local single_int = ipv4_to_int(cidr_str)\\n    if single_int then\\n        return ip_int == single_int\\n    end\\n    return false\\nend\\n\\n-- 检查 IP(字符串) 是否在任一 CIDR 内\\nlocal function ip_in_cidrs(ip_str, cidrs)\\n    local ip_int = ipv4_to_int(ip_str)\\n    if not ip_int then return false end\\n    for _, cidr in ipairs(cidrs) do\\n        if ip_in_cidr(ip_int, cidr) then\\n            return true\\n        end\\n    end\\n    return false\\nend\\n\\nfunction _M.check(conf_data)\\n    if conf_data == nil then\\n        return\\n    end\\n\\n    -- 读取可信 CDN 节点白名单\\n    local trusted_cidrs = conf_data[\\\"trusted_cidrs\\\"]\\n    if type(trusted_cidrs) ~= \\\"table\\\" or #trusted_cidrs == 0 then\\n        return\\n    end\\n\\n    -- 获取实际 TCP 连接源 IP\\n    local remote_addr = ngx.var.remote_addr\\n    if not remote_addr then\\n        return\\n    end\\n\\n    -- 源 IP 不在可信白名单内，不提取（防伪造）\\n    if not ip_in_cidrs(remote_addr, trusted_cidrs) then\\n        return\\n    end\\n\\n    -- 源 IP 可信，提取 cdn-src-ip 作为真实客户端 IP\\n    local headers = ngx.req.get_headers()\\n    local cdn_src_ip = headers[\\\"cdn-src-ip\\\"]\\n    if cdn_src_ip then\\n        if type(cdn_src_ip) == \\\"table\\\" then\\n            cdn_src_ip = cdn_src_ip[1]\\n        end\\n        cdn_src_ip = (tostring(cdn_src_ip):gsub(\\\"^%s+\\\", \\\"\\\"):gsub(\\\"%s+$\\\", \\\"\\\"))\\n        if ipv4_to_int(cdn_src_ip) then\\n            ngx.ctx.src_ip = cdn_src_ip\\n        end\\n    end\\n\\n    return\\nend\\n\\nreturn _M\",\"conf\":\"{\\\"trusted_cidrs\\\": [\\\"111.0.0.0/8\\\", \\\"112.0.0.0/8\\\"]}\"},\"result\":\"{\\\"script_type\\\":\\\"component\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"cdn_real_ip_extractor\\\",\\\"detail\\\":\\\"华为云CDN场景真实客户端IP提取组件。检查实际TCP连接源IP是否在可信CDN节点白名单(trusted_cidrs)内，仅可信来源才提取 cdn-src-ip 头作为真实客户端IP写入 ngx.ctx.src_ip，防止绕过CDN直连伪造。\\\",\\\"config_json\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"trusted_cidrs\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"111.0.0.0/8\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"112.0.0.0/8\\\\\\\"]}\\\",\\\"cli_command\\\":\\\"python tools/waf_cli.py component create \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --name cdn_real_ip_extractor \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --detail \\\\\\\"华为云CDN场景真实客户端IP提取组件。检查实际TCP连接源IP是否在可信CDN节点白名单(trusted_cidrs)内，仅可信来源才提取 cdn-src-ip 头作为真实客户端IP写入 ngx.ctx.src_ip，防止绕过CDN直连伪造。\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --code-file generated/\\\\u003cproject\\\\u003e/components/cdn_real_ip_extractor/code.lua \\\\\\\\\\\\n  --conf '{\\\\\\\"trusted_cidrs\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"111.0.0.0/8\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"112.0.0.0/8\\\\\\\"]}'\\\",\\\"code_lua\\\":\\\"local _M = {}\\\\n\\\\nlocal bit = require \\\\\\\"bit\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n-- IPv4 转为 32 位整数\\\\nlocal function ipv4_to_int(ip)\\\\n    if type(ip) ~= \\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\" then\\\\n        return nil\\\\n    end\\\\n    local a, b, c, d = ip:match(\\\\\\\"^(%d+)%.(%d+)%.(%d+)%.(%d+)$\\\\\\\")\\\\n    if not a then\\\\n        return nil\\\\n    end\\\\n    a, b, c, d = tonumber(a), tonumber(b), tonumber(c), tonumber(d)\\\\n    if not (a and b and c and d) then return nil end\\\\n    if a \\\\u003e 255 or b \\\\u003e 255 or c \\\\u003e 255 or d \\\\u003e 255 then return nil end\\\\n    return bit.bor(bit.lshift(a, 24), bit.lshift(b, 16), bit.lshift(c, 8), d)\\\\nend\\\\n\\\\n-- 检查 IP(整数) 是否在单个 CIDR 范围内\\\\nlocal function ip_in_cidr(ip_int, cidr_str)\\\\n    -- 带掩码: 1.2.3.0/24\\\\n    local cidr_ip, mask_bits = cidr_str:match(\\\\\\\"^(%d+%.%d+%.%d+%.%d+)/(%d+)$\\\\\\\")\\\\n    if cidr_ip then\\\\n        local cidr_int = ipv4_to_int(cidr_ip)\\\\n        if not cidr_int then return false end\\\\n        mask_bits = tonumber(mask_bits)\\\\n        if mask_bits \\\\u003c 0 or mask_bits \\\\u003e 32 then return false end\\\\n        if mask_bits == 0 then return true end\\\\n        local mask_int = bit.bnot(bit.rshift(0xFFFFFFFF, mask_bits))\\\\n        return bit.band(ip_int, mask_int) == bit.band(cidr_int, mask_int)\\\\n    end\\\\n    -- 不带掩码: 单个 IP\\\\n    local single_int = ipv4_to_int(cidr_str)\\\\n    if single_int then\\\\n        return ip_int == single_int\\\\n    end\\\\n    return false\\\\nend\\\\n\\\\n-- 检查 IP(字符串) 是否在任一 CIDR 内\\\\nlocal function ip_in_cidrs(ip_str, cidrs)\\\\n    local ip_int = ipv4_to_int(ip_str)\\\\n    if not ip_int then return false end\\\\n    for _, cidr in ipairs(cidrs) do\\\\n        if ip_in_cidr(ip_int, cidr) then\\\\n            return true\\\\n        end\\\\n    end\\\\n    return false\\\\nend\\\\n\\\\nfunction _M.check(conf_data)\\\\n    if conf_data == nil then\\\\n        return\\\\n    end\\\\n\\\\n    -- 读取可信 CDN 节点白名单\\\\n    local trusted_cidrs = conf_data[\\\\\\\"trusted_cidrs\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    if type(trusted_cidrs) ~= \\\\\\\"table\\\\\\\" or #trusted_cidrs == 0 then\\\\n        return\\\\n    end\\\\n\\\\n    -- 获取实际 TCP 连接源 IP\\\\n    local remote_addr = ngx.var.remote_addr\\\\n    if not remote_addr then\\\\n        return\\\\n    end\\\\n\\\\n    -- 源 IP 不在可信白名单内，不提取（防伪造）\\\\n    if not ip_in_cidrs(remote_addr, trusted_cidrs) then\\\\n        return\\\\n    end\\\\n\\\\n    -- 源 IP 可信，提取 cdn-src-ip 作为真实客户端 IP\\\\n    local headers = ngx.req.get_headers()\\\\n    local cdn_src_ip = headers[\\\\\\\"cdn-src-ip\\\\\\\"]\\\\n    if cdn_src_ip then\\\\n        if type(cdn_src_ip) == \\\\\\\"table\\\\\\\" then\\\\n            cdn_src_ip = cdn_src_ip[1]\\\\n        end\\\\n        cdn_src_ip = (tostring(cdn_src_ip):gsub(\\\\\\\"^%s+\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"):gsub(\\\\\\\"%s+$\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\"))\\\\n        if ipv4_to_int(cdn_src_ip) then\\\\n            ngx.ctx.src_ip = cdn_src_ip\\\\n        end\\\\n    end\\\\n\\\\n    return\\\\nend\\\\n\\\\nreturn _M\\\",\\\"conf_json\\\":\\\"{\\\\\\\"trusted_cidrs\\\\\\\": [\\\\\\\"111.0.0.0/8\\\\\\\", \\\\\\\"112.0.0.0/8\\\\\\\"]}\\\",\\\"base64_cmd\\\":\\\"python3 -c \\\\\\\"import base64; print(base64.b64encode(open('generated/\\\\u003cproject\\\\u003e/components/cdn_real_ip_extractor/code.lua','rb').read()).decode('ascii'))\\\\\\\" \\\\u003e generated/\\\\u003cproject\\\\u003e/components/cdn_real_ip_extractor/code.base64\\\",\\\"explanation\\\":\\\"防护组件 cdn_real_ip_extractor。Lua 代码 2657 字节，请确认兼容 LuaJIT（Lua 5.1）。\\\"}\",\"success\":true}","time":"2026-06-19T12:11:11+08:00","type":"tool_call"}
{"data":"配置脚本已生成，下面是预览：\n\n---\n\n### 组件名\n`cdn_real_ip_extractor`\n\n### 组件描述\n华为云CDN场景真实客户端IP提取组件。检查实际TCP连接源IP是否在可信CDN节点白名单(`trusted_cidrs`)内，仅可信来源才提取 `cdn-src-ip` 头作为真实客户端IP写入 `ngx.ctx.src_ip`，防止绕过CDN直连伪造。\n\n### 组件配置（conf）\n```json\n{\n  \"trusted_cidrs\": [\"111.0.0.0/8\", \"112.0.0.0/8\"]\n}\n```\n\u003e 配置为 JSON 数组，支持单 IP（如 `1.2.3.4`）和 CIDR 网段（如 `111.0.0.0/8`），按华为云 CDN 节点实际出口 IP 填写。\n\n### 核心逻辑\n\n```\n请求到达 WAF\n  │\n  ├─ 1. 读取 ngx.var.remote_addr（实际 TCP 连接源 IP）\n  │\n  ├─ 2. 检查 remote_addr 是否在 trusted_cidrs 白名单内？\n  │     ├─ 不在 → 不提取，直接返回（防止攻击者绕过 CDN 伪造 cdn-src-ip）\n  │     └─ 在 → 继续\n  │\n  ├─ 3. 读取 cdn-src-ip 请求头\n  │\n  └─ 4. 校验格式合法 → 写入 ngx.ctx.src_ip\n         后续所有 WAF 模块（规则匹配、流量统计、名单防护）将使用此 IP\n```\n\n### 关键安全设计\n\n| 场景 | 行为 |\n|------|------|\n| 华为云 CDN 节点发来请求 | `remote_addr` 在白名单 → 提取 `cdn-src-ip` ✅ |\n| 攻击者直连 WAF 伪造 `cdn-src-ip` | `remote_addr` 不在白名单 → 不提取 ❌ |\n| 白名单为空/未配置 | 不提取任何 IP ❌ |\n\n确认无误后，回复「**应用**」即可将组件下发到 WAF。","time":"2026-06-19T12:11:23+08:00","type":"assistant_text"}
